//> @attr dataSourceField.storeWithHash (HashAlgorithm : varies : IR)
// If set, causes the field to be securely hashed before saving on an "add" or "update"
// operation.
// <p>
// The default is null except for fields of +link{type}: "password", for which the default is
// "bcrypt".  To disable hashing for password fields, you must set this property to "none".
//
// @serverDS only
