// level.
// <p>
// Note that this setting overrides the equivalent
// +link{dataSource.multiInsertBatchSize,dataSource setting}, and can in turn be overridden at
// the +link{dsRequest.multiInsertBatchSize,DSRequest level}
//
// @serverDS only
// @see OperationBinding.multiInsertStrategy
// @see OperationBinding.multiInsertNonMatchingStrategy
// @visibility external
//<

//> @attr operationBinding.multiInsertNonMatchingStrategy (MultiInsertNonMatchingStrategy : "padWithNulls" : IRW)
// For "add" operations on dataSources of +link{dataSource.serverType,serverType} "sql" only,
// this property sets the multi-insert "non matching" strategy for this
// +link{class:OperationBinding,operation}.  Only has an effect if the
// +link{DataSource.addData(),add request} specifies a list of records as the data, and only
// if +link{operationBinding.multiInsertStrategy,multiInsertStrategy}
// is set to "multipleValues" either globally or at the +link{class:DSRequest,DSRequest},
// +link{class:OperationBinding,OperationBinding}, or +link{class:DataSource,DataSource}
// level.
// <p>
// Note that this setting overrides the equivalent
// +link{dataSource.multiInsertNonMatchingStrategy,dataSource setting}, and can in turn be overridden at
